   37 00000000         ;* V1.0, Jan, 21, 2013 TYS:Startup file for XMC1
   38 00000000         ;* V1.1, Jul, 17, 2013 TYS:remove redundant vector table
   39 00000000         ;* V1.2, Nov, 25, 2014 JFT:Removed DAVE3 dependency. 
   40 00000000         ;*                         Default handler used for all I
                       RQs
   41 00000000         ;* V1.3, Dec, 11, 2014 JFT:Default clocking changed, MCLK
                       =32MHz and PCLK=64MHz
   42 00000000         ;* V1.4, Sep, 03, 2015 JFT:SSW default clocking changed, 
                       MCLK=8MHz and PCLK=16MHz avoid problems with BMI tool tim
                       eout
